\newlabel{tab:ladder-adaptation}{{4.4}{43}{Degradation seen at inference only, against degradation present during training as well, for the distilled student at full severity. The matched-condition column is a single seed and is not directly comparable in precision to the three-seed cross-condition column; it is reported to establish the size of the effect, which is large, not its exact value}{table.caption.38}{}}
