\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4.5}{\ignorespaces Sensor invariance of the teacher and the distilled student, over $800$ co-registered test patches. Paired cosine and probe transfer compare the two sensor views of the \emph  {same} ground. Probe transfer fits a linear classifier on Sentinel-2 embeddings and applies it to $\Phi $-sat-2 embeddings; retention is the ratio of the two accuracies. The IoU difference is measured on the full test split rather than on the $800$-patch embedding sample. }}{44}{table.caption.39}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:invariance}{{4.5}{44}{Sensor invariance of the teacher and the distilled student, over $800$ co-registered test patches. Paired cosine and probe transfer compare the two sensor views of the \emph {same} ground. Probe transfer fits a linear classifier on Sentinel-2 embeddings and applies it to $\Phi $-sat-2 embeddings; retention is the ratio of the two accuracies. The IoU difference is measured on the full test split rather than on the $800$-patch embedding sample}{table.caption.39}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.4}{\ignorespaces Distribution of the domain probe's out-of-fold decision score, the quantity from which PAD is computed. Separated modes imply a probe that never errs (PAD $\rightarrow 2$); overlapping modes imply chance (PAD $\rightarrow 0$). After standardising each domain on its own statistics (right column) the separability vanishes for both models, showing that all of it was per-channel mean and scale, not representational structure. }}{45}{figure.caption.40}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pad-decision}{{4.4}{45}{Distribution of the domain probe's out-of-fold decision score, the quantity from which PAD is computed. Separated modes imply a probe that never errs (PAD $\rightarrow 2$); overlapping modes imply chance (PAD $\rightarrow 0$). After standardising each domain on its own statistics (right column) the separability vanishes for both models, showing that all of it was per-channel mean and scale, not representational structure}{figure.caption.40}{}}
